      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1864 a group of escaped slaves traveled via the Underground Railroad to Chambersburg, then settled in Royalton along the Swatara Creek feeder to Buck Lock.",
